     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing an emotional strain",
     "texto": [
      "**En påkjenning** is an experience or strain that demands a lot of effort. **Selvfølelse** is the value a person places on themselves.",
      "**Å sette grenser** is to set limits; **å håndtere** is to face or manage something."
     ],
